Q: Is it possible to copy row (with data, merging, style) in Excel using Epplus? A: <p>I just made copies of rows</p>
<pre><code>for (int i = 0; i &lt; invoiceList.Count; i++)
{
    workSheet.Cells[1, 1, totalRows, totalCols].Copy(workSheet.Cells[i * totalRows + 1, 1]);
}
</code></pre>
<p>If you want to copy range just use:</p>
<pre><code>workSheet.Cells[&quot;A1:I1&quot;].Copy(workSheet.Cells[&quot;A4:I4&quot;]);
</code></pre>
